<title>Southern Thailand: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/thailand/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-thailand-2026-11-08T06:24:33.304Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sun, 08 Nov 2026 06:24:33 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Thai forces have tightened border security after a Myanmar spillover injured a civilian on Oct 29 and after Myanmar military and the KNU exchanged blame for shelling on Thai territory. Laos and Myanmar have agreed to strengthen border security cooperation, while Thailand is pushing Laos-China rail connections and a cross-border e-CNY payment link with China, and the Malaysia-Thailand East Coast Rail Link is nearing the Thai border. Cambodia urged full compliance with ICJ rulings at the UN General Assembly, and Thailand warned of lower travel demand after threats to European flights. The Thai government also pushed back on a Chinese alert and debated a 340‑baht fee for Koh Chang. 35 battle-related deaths were recorded in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiX0FVX3lxTFBwaWI3aFEzLV9ISDVPTWduR2pkRFBuMEFmMVZNOEt4R1g0MXMtU1ZmSFdVbzZla0EtT3o2a192NDNHbkd1UXh1TklRMjBOZi1vYWNXX3lLN1BXM0tSUXVr?oc=5&quot;&gt;Nation Thailand&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiwAFBVV95cUxOb0dDLUNfSm5xTDBrSm9KZUIzcHZabUQ1X0FPQ1FiazBROHNYTlRJZjUzR2hxaS1MeDNoYnBLaHJpZ080bEZLeUR1RV9CQW03MkZTM1lqUjVtWk9ieXJmNGtQVlZIRUxFc01YNmlVTkhrNGptV1E4TGd6TGxOS3FncFZwa0FmWUlGS1Z1X0lGNlRHWlJ0N1hOVTFndlZFMV9mbVFpQy1kb0RZSk1TZFNXbjNCWTdiMkNIdjJ4NGRMbjQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Star&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiYEFVX3lxTE5lWkw4aFJ5RVBfM2VfRThqOU1wOGZJM1l2SHYxN0ZNOWJ3WE1tTEtPRmhPc3hqeUh5WjZnV055Z1lEOF9EZDc0NEcxTzRiSHJsNldKUENZT2ZZaEZOZHNtUw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Thai PBS World&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiX0FVX3lxTE9qc2dlMVIzNEZNSmg3dVlUN2RTNFg1X0JUbWw1UFI5ZXV2U090VC1xaEVDaEF1dHVGbjM2WUlkRU1ObDFEQ1ZPT2dDQ2tGeDN4eWd6Y3UxbmctX1c0R3g4?oc=5&quot;&gt;Nation Thailand&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/